@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
title Shortfall checking: architectural context
top to bottom direction

component "Terminal interaction\nMishMash" as App
component "Command parsing\nParser + CheckShortfallParser" as Parsing
component "Read-only action\nCheckShortfallCommand" as Check
component "Session models\nActiveMealPlan, MealPlan, DayPlan,\nRecipe, NutritionTargets" as Models

App ..> Parsing : parseCommand(input)
Parsing ..> Check : creates command
App ..> Check : execute(recipeBook)\nvia the Command interface
Parsing ..> Models : creates targets;\nshares active-plan holder
Check ..> Models : reads plan, totals\nand targets

note bottom of App
  Displays the returned String
  or a recoverable input error.
end note
note bottom of Check
  No model setters, generation calls,
  storage writes, or confirmation.
end note
legend bottom
  Feature-level groupings of existing classes; unrelated commands are omitted.
  Dashed arrows show dependencies, not new Java interfaces.
endlegend
@enduml
